 text-white/90\">Incorporation</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/incorporation\">Start Company</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/incorporation/states\">State Comparison</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-white/15 pt-8 text-xs text-white/50 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 Wolfitpark. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/refund\">Refunds</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/shipping\">Shipping</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-white\" href=\"/cookies\">Cookies</a></div></div></div></div></footer></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Wolfitpark\",\"url\":\"https://wolfitpark.online\",\"email\":\"support@wolfitpark.online\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"30 N Gould St\",\"addressLocality\":\"Sheridan\",\"addressRegion\":\"WY\",\"postalCode\":\"82801\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"},\"sameAs\":[]}</script><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0tp6kbpf5uu08.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><section class=\"section-pad\"><div class=\"container-site max-w-4xl\"><span data-slot=\"badge\" data-variant=\"outline\" class=\"group/badge inline-flex h-5 w-fit shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 overflow-hidden rounded-4xl border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3! border-border text-foreground [a]:hover:bg-muted [a]:hover:text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Legal</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl\">Cookie Policy</h1><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Last updated: <!-- -->July 25, 2026</p><div class=\"mt-12 space-y-10\"><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">1. What Are Cookies</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Cookies are small text files stored on your device (computer, tablet, mobile) when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently, enhance user experience, and provide information to website owners. Similar technologies include web beacons, pixel tags, and local storage.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">2. How We Use Cookies</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Wolfitpark LLC uses cookies and similar technologies for the following purposes: (a) Essential/Strictly Necessary — required for website operation, including authentication, security, and session management; (b) Analytics/Performance — to understand how visitors interact with our website, measure traffic, and improve performance; (c) Functional/Preference — to remember your preferences, language, and region settings; (d) Targeting/Advertising — used sparingly to deliver relevant content and measure campaign effectiveness.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">3. Cookies We Use</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Essential cookies: session cookies for login authentication, CSRF tokens for security, load balancing cookies. Analytics cookies: Google Analytics (anonymized IP), Vercel Analytics, PostHog (self-hosted). Functional cookies: theme preference, language selection, recently viewed items. We do not use third-party advertising cookies without your explicit consent.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">4. Third-Party Cookies</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Some cookies are placed by trusted third-party services we use: (a) Vercel — website hosting and analytics; (b) Stripe — payment processing (does not use cookies for tracking); (c) Google Analytics — anonymized usage analytics; (d) Resend — email delivery and analytics. These third parties have their own privacy and cookie policies.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">5. Your Cookie Choices</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">When you first visit our website, you are presented with a cookie consent banner that allows you to accept or decline non-essential cookies. You can manage cookies through: (a) Our cookie consent manager (accessible at any time via the Privacy link); (b) Your browser settings (block, delete, or allow cookies); (c) Opt-out tools for specific services (e.g., Google Analytics opt-out). Note that disabling essential cookies may impact website functionality.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">6. Do Not Track Signals</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our website honors Do Not Track (DNT) signals where supported. When we detect a DNT signal, we limit tracking to essential cookies only.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">7. Data Collected via Cookies</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Cookies may collect: IP address, browser type and version, operating system, referring URL, pages visited, time spent on pages, and click patterns. This data is aggregated and anonymized where possible.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">8. Cookie Retention</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Session cookies expire when you close your browser. Persistent cookies remain on your device for up to 12 months or until manually deleted. You can delete persistent cookies through your browser settings at any time.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">9. Updates to This Policy</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We may update this Cookie Policy. Changes will be posted here with an updated revision date. Material changes will be communicated via cookie consent banner or email.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">10. Contact</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">For questions about our use of cookies, contact: Wolfitpark LLC, 30 N Gould St, Sheridan, WY 82801, USA. Email: privacy@wolfitpark.online.</p></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if(\"/$\"===d||\"/&\"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else\"$\"!==d&&\"$?\"!==d&&\"$~\"!==d&&\"$!\"!==d&&\"&\"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data=\"$\";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};\n$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data=\"$~\",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&(\"number\"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC(\"B:0\",\"S:0\")</script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:I[12224,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0w2c.i2ky0ich.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0anfux3ged1uf.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09l