t Are Cookies\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Cookies are small text files stored on your device (computer, tablet, mobile) when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently, enhance user experience, and provide information to website owners. Similar technologies include web beacons, pixel tags, and local storage.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2. How We Use Cookies\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"2. How We Use Cookies\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Wolfitpark LLC uses cookies and similar technologies for the following purposes: (a) Essential/Strictly Necessary — required for website operation, including authentication, security, and session management; (b) Analytics/Performance — to understand how visitors interact with our website, measure traffic, and improve performance; (c) Functional/Preference — to remember your preferences, language, and region settings; (d) Targeting/Advertising — used sparingly to deliver relevant content and measure campaign effectiveness.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"3. Cookies We Use\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"3. Cookies We Use\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Essential cookies: session cookies for login authentication, CSRF tokens for security, load balancing cookies. Analytics cookies: Google Analytics (anonymized IP), Vercel Analytics, PostHog (self-hosted). Functional cookies: theme preference, language selection, recently viewed items. We do not use third-party advertising cookies without your explicit consent.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4. Third-Party Cookies\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"4. Third-Party Cookies\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{